abstract: >-
  Open educational resources for a one-day workshop for doctoral
  candidates and postdocs. The workshop examines generative AI through
  four lenses: scale and environment, representation, lifecycle and
  labour, and political economy. Participants apply the lenses to their
  own research uses in groups, then use two blocks of the Liberating
  Structures Panarchy to find feasible changes in their own research, and
  write an individual action plan. The materials include lesson pages,
  Reveal.js slide decks, two printable sheets, a facilitator guide, and
  a template for a responsible generative AI use statement.
keywords:
  - generative AI
  - AI ethics
  - research integrity
